ple","tone":"warn"},{"label":"Regulation FD disclosure","kind":"news","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834376/000183437626000005/0001834376-26-000005-index.htm"},{"date":"2026-01-12","form":"8-K","codes":["7.01","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Regulation FD disclosure","kind":"news","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834376/000183437626000003/0001834376-26-000003-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-12-04","form":"8-K","codes":["5.07"],"events":[{"label":"Shareholder vote results","kind":"governance","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834376/000183437625000078/0001834376-25-000078-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-11-04","form":"8-K","codes":["2.02","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Results announced","kind":"results","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834376/000183437625000072/0001834376-25-000072-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-10-23","form":"8-K","codes":["5.02"],"events":[{"label":"Director or officer departure or appointment","kind":"people","tone":"warn"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834376/000183437625000065/0001834376-25-000065-index.htm"}],"legal_events":[],"summary":{"sentences":["InnovAge Holding Corp. files with the SEC under \"Services-Health Services\", based in CO, and has been publicly reporting for 5 years.","It reported $945.9m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 15.5% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 24.2%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it is still consuming cash, with roughly 71 months of runway at the current burn."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 15.5% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $251.9m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834376/000183437626000022/0001834376-26-000022-index.htm","accession":"0001834376-26-000022"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834376/000183437626000022/0001834376-26-000022-index.htm","accession":"0001834376-26-000022"},{"text":"Gross margin expanded from 18.7% to 24.2% against the same quarter a year earlier - the company is keeping more of what it sells, not buying growth with discounts.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834376/000183437626000022/0001834376-26-000022-index.htm","accession":"0001834376-26-000022"},{"text":"Net cash of $80.6m against total assets of $547.4m - no debt overhang forcing decisions.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834376/000183437626000022/0001834376-26-000022-index.htm","accession":"0001834376-26-000022"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (0.4% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834376/000183437626000022/0001834376-26-000022-index.htm","accession":"0001834376-26-000022"}],"bear":[{"text":"Gross margin is only 24.2%, so scale has to be enormous before anything reaches the bottom line.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834376/000183437626000022/0001834376-26-000022-index.htm","accession":"0001834376-26-000022"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-11.5% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834376/000183437626000022/0001834376-26-000022-index.htm","accession":"0001834376-26-000022"},{"text":"The operating loss widened by $18.9m against the same quarter a year earlier - it is getting worse, not better.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834376/000183437626000022/0001834376-26-000022-index.htm","accession":"0001834376-26-000022"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 1.3% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1834376/000189646326000006/0001896463-26-000006-index.htm"},{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 16.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.16,"consecutive":2,"current":0.242,"current_display":"24.2%","threshold_display":"16.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Eight points of margin is a real deterioration rather than noise. Two consecutive quarters stops one bad quarter from forcing a sale.","editable":true},{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below 0.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":0.0,"consecutive":2,"current":0.155,"current_display":"15.5%","threshold_display":"0.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"If growth halves and stays there, the reason you looked at this company has gone.","editable":true},{"id":"runway_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Cash runway falls below 12 months","metric":"runway_months","comparison":"below","threshold":12.0,"consecutive":1,"current":70.919,"current_display":"71 months","threshold_display":"12 months","fired":false,"rationale":"Below twelve months the company raises on whatever terms it can get, and that dilution lands on you.","editable":true},{"id":"dilution_ceiling","kind":"metric","label":"Diluted share count growth rises above 10.0%","metric":"dilution_yoy","comparison":"above","threshold":0.1,"consecutive":1,"current":0.004,"current_display":"0.4%","threshold_display":"10.0%","fired":fa